{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/banner_story_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shouichi, Azuha, and Emily are summoned to another world, but just as they confront the Demon Lord, she escapes to another realm. With no choice, they must follow her to return home. However, they soon discover their abilities are mysteriously sealed, leaving them as ordinary, powerless humans. Azuha, whose powers are desired by King Caldier, volunteers to stay behind in exchange for Shouichi and Emily\u2019s freedom. Feeling something is off, Azuha urges them to gather intel. Realizing they\u2019re caught in a dangerous power struggle, and with having just a week until negotiations are over, Shouichi and Emily race against time to uncover the truth and save Azuha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/banner_gameplay_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features RPG-style mechanics where you have to fight enemies, learn new skills, power your characters up, and explore the world. Save your allies from the clutches of evil or avenge them if it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/banner_characters_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/character_Shouichi_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/character_Emily_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/character_Azuha_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/character_Caldier_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/character_Mika_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/character_Eurice_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/character_Sierra_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/character_DerrisanOtapus_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/character_EmpressLulua_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/character_PrincessSuzuko_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/banner_features_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies to gain experience and level up. Learn new skills and experiment with different skill combinations to face any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choice Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The choices you make throughout the game will have an impact on how the story progresses and what fate awaits you at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully balance limited resources such as time and money to ensure your success through your jouney.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670820?t=1745709461","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/9cfed34fc750be30d10c9dfe5bd0a24e161495a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745709461","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/09844b32cee94b7c6abce5564e89ad7a7753db3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745709461","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/09844b32cee94b7c6abce5564e89ad7a7753db3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745709461","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670820/extras/banner_story_EN.png?t=1745709461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shouichi, Azuha, and Emily are summoned to another world, but just as they confront the Demon Lord, she escapes to another realm. With no choice, they must follow her to return home. However, they soon discover their abilities are mysteriously sealed, leaving them as ordinary, powerless humans. Azuha, whose powers are desired by King Caldier, volunteers to stay behind in exchange for Shouichi and Emily\u2019s freedom. Feeling something is off, Azuha urges them to gather intel. Realizing they\u2019re caught in a dangerous power struggle, and with having just a week until negotiations are over, Shouichi and Emily race against time to uncover the truth and save Azuha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class